{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e8fb4c7338cf233c1629bab63ca8e8e2460770e58d271c7ec2e31d63a360ef52", "ja": "（長野での仕事を終えた翌日。\nのり子と軽井沢に向かい、観光地を巡っていた……）", "zh": "（结束长野工作后的第二天。\n和纪子一起前往轻井泽，游览了各处景点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca457384e98e83295c2050055a08c348bafe78159dac1a9aac7431aee6a2cfd3", "ja": "はぁ、ビックリした……。すっごくキレイだったから、\nてっきり美術館か何かかな～って思ったんだよね。", "zh": "哈，吓我一跳……因为实在太漂亮了，我还以为是什么美术馆之类的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "68858ee45af7b6028c642784c32cf74394799fa023d6b8f0f22cde4a4340947e", "ja": "まさか結婚式場だったなんて……。\nどおりで、お姉さんと話が噛み合わないわけだ……。", "zh": "真没想到居然是婚礼礼堂……\n怪不得刚才跟那位大姐姐完全聊不到一块去呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1003_p", "source_sha256": "df61e30ef3dcd3da414296c931728e5125b9dd3800f0f454606606859b17f09a", "ja": "はは、そうだな。結婚式の下見に来たカップルだと\n思われて、いろいろ質問されたしな。", "zh": "哈哈，确实是这样。我们被当成来踩点婚礼场地的情侣，\n还被问了各种各样的问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "23cf6a666bd3020ca48cea53c08a86ad99bff4b8f1cf09c10c447d546479ac29", "ja": "うん……。アタシ達のことを知らない人には、\nそういう風に見えるってこと、だよね……。はあ～。", "zh": "嗯……。对不认识我们的人来说，看起来就是那样吧……。唉～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8b121409fdbc7d49746d9c44be549f7d18167f9d7d6d4c3aceff2b12c387fa5d", "ja": "のり子……。ごめんな。\nもっと早く式場だって気づければよかったんだけど。", "zh": "典子……对不起。\n要是能早点发现那是婚礼场地就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "3e27f1e81cca32f2f52401bd477286d4af4cdec84d70eaa4d7089d3086e9f2bf", "ja": "えっ！？\nなんで{$P$}が謝るの？", "zh": "诶！？\n为什么要由{$P$}道歉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1007_p", "source_sha256": "645c055b59862a334bb4477270ce9ffe464b36c5c4aea635fc26971109d675ce", "ja": "勘違いされて嫌な気持ちになったのかなって……。\n今も、大きなため息をついてたし。", "zh": "我在想，你是不是因为被误会了，心里觉得不舒服……\n而且刚才你还重重地叹了口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "373414807e91fab43097759708ec0179eec9b1488d4dbc08a09da3aeb67f0a36", "ja": "あっ、違う違う！　嫌だったとか、\nそういう意味のため息じゃないから！", "zh": "啊，不是不是！并不是讨厌什么的，\n叹气不是那个意思啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "992062e81435f225110dc7444bb4558500d4edfe969ab091bb2aab07a0314ede", "ja": "むしろ逆で、ちょっと困るっていうか……。", "zh": "恰恰相反，该说是有点为难……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "b0189413b659f186838f16968e0249ff343ce8fb7bbd5f83ebfd814cf419f48f", "ja": "って、何言ってるんだろ。　えっと……\nとにかく、嫌な気持ちとかじゃないから気にしないで！", "zh": "我这是在说什么啊。那个……\n总之，我没有觉得讨厌，你别在意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8487b82cd3d44d50986297e5b20fb92e673597590703a3969d89e3e5d81d722b", "ja": "そうか？　それならいいんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊？那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "38acafaada67b6f908a8df0d79769a9d073502c16403a5698c2ea54d5277d787", "ja": "うん！　気にしなーい気にしない！\nそれより、さっきの場所、よかったよね～。", "zh": "嗯！别在意别在意啦！\n比起这个，刚才那个地方很不错吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "8b87e2f580b62646368b3cc3c6680c259544d5e2e48d12c07be113cff4682846", "ja": "建物も内装もすっごく素敵でさ……。", "zh": "建筑和内饰都超级棒的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8633cdb46b3ec8d6999a76e9ae8f9983a8c54c1164d71c8d9c4d14981a3f7b55", "ja": "そうだな。のり子も憧れたりするのか？\nああいう場所で結婚式をしたいとか。", "zh": "是啊。你也会憧憬那种地方吗？\n比如想在那样的地方举办婚礼之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "f5c8eca9bca48b3cf9460e82e6ba53cb2ab59d42fb9bcbd48a51eeddfc26cade", "ja": "へっ、アタシ？　ど、どうかな～。\n結婚とか、正直考えたこともないけど……。", "zh": "诶，我？这、这很难说啊～  \n结婚什么的，说实话我从来没想过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "ad3a16d2d238411b7c0a3c6b99adf88b03667f38987c107f5dcf5ee28c8299c4", "ja": "……でも、まぁ……うん。\n想像してみたら、意外と悪くない……かも？", "zh": "……不过，怎么说呢……嗯。\n想象了一下，好像意外地也不赖……也许？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cfd99efd4d9441bc1755e3938544f11906d47ba2ce01f0870199eaf7497b014e", "ja": "想像？　どんな風に？", "zh": "想象？会是什么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "3fdfe170a7e1b4e1cf73ea61c9ea2ed8813873610e4af2aa169f03c55fb054ff", "ja": "そりゃ、さっきの場所で結婚式とかしてさ。\nアタシの隣には……ハッ！", "zh": "当然是在刚才那个地方举办婚礼什么的。\n在我身边……哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1019_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "83884cab5c919ea97f5cc753ad75513d700f9048f238f292ffbdfcc50f8db3d1", "ja": "ナシナシ！　今のは聞かなかったことにして！\nほら、恋人もいないのに結婚なんて早すぎるでしょ？", "zh": "不行不行！刚才那句话就当没听见吧！\n你看，连恋人都没有，谈结婚不是还太早了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0394_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0394_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "af9d96a34feac17cb1820e441fa6ff4c82ef158dc4b98fa66551d8419ed6a0c8", "ja": "そういう話は、また機会があったらね！\n……はあ～。油断できないんだから。", "zh": "这种话，等下次有机会再说吧！\n……唉～，真是一刻都不能大意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
